### Add to cart
POST http://localhost:8083/api/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "productName": "iPhone 15",
  "price": 79999.00,
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Checkout — this publishes order.created to Kafka
POST http://localhost:8083/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "shippingAddress": "123 MG Road, Bangalore"
}